    "no_outer_validation_tuning": true,
    "id": "V194",
    "label": "Inner-crossfitted spectral/local evidence combination",
    "method": "inner_fusion",
    "weight_penalty": 0.02,
    "replaces_base_head": true,
    "formula": "For each outer fold,3 inner splits of6k train base18/global, spectral29/global, local18/V178 heads on4k and predict held2k. Fit w_s,w_l in[0,1.5] by BCE(z_base+w_s*(z_s-z_base)+w_l*(z_l-z_base))+.02/2*((w_s-1)^2+(w_l-1)^2). Apply weights to full6k corrected-Kumo heads; final=.75*sigmoid(eta)+.25*original_spline77",
    "rationale": "V185 fixed logit fusion increases pooledKS but only3/5folds and mixed public outcome. Learn complementarity using strictly inner-OOF predictions, never using in-sample original spline or outer labels for mixing weights. Difference from V185 includes fusion before original spline and training-only weight fit."
  },
